/* description */ (
'Beam target for the XIAO ESP32-S3 Sense, chassis: slides into an open
UC2 cube, two rigid rails on -x seat on the 45 deg edge chamfers (x, z
); two long flexure arms on +x press on the throat walls, two lands on
 -x limit the roll. Camera block in a square seat, XIAO from the back,
 USB-C from the top. PETG, print on the front face, no supports.'),
/* implementation_level */ '2;1');

